# Keeping the build context small matters here: node_modules alone is GBs, and a
# fat context is copied to the daemon on every build before any layer is cached.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.DS_Store
docs
brand
*.md
!README.md
